# Fixture of iso_check: messages compared in order per sender, totals as a bag, invariants, every line covered
fact msg \[(\w+) -> (\w+)\]: (.*)
fact total total=(\d+)
section ^----
ignore ^$
cover all
same msg seq by 1
same total bag
check msg count by 1 == 2
check total sum(1) == 30
check msg distinct(1) in [2,2]
